`,Xr={site:[{slug:`site`,f1:`argus`,f2:"AI 自动化工作室",f3:"为团队打造日常使用的 AI 智能体与自动化流程，覆盖客服、销售运营和后台事务，数周即可上线。",f4:`hello@argus.ai`,f5:`+1 646 555 0187`,f6:"纽约",f7:`America/New_York`,f8:`/book`,f9:`X:https://x.com, LinkedIn:https://linkedin.com, YouTube:https://youtube.com`,f10:"第四季度项目预约中 · 剩余 3 个名额",f11:"美国纽约市西 21 街 54 号，邮编 10010",f12:"周一至周五 09:00–18:00（美国东部时间）",f13:`1-5 09:00-18:00`,n1:`1`}],reviews:[{slug:`r1`,f1:"三周内，语音智能体就接管了我们的电话。患者听不出来，前台也终于有时间照顾现场的人了。",f2:`Dr. Sarah Kim`,f3:"医疗总监",f4:`Northwind Dental`,img:`https://framerusercontent.com/images/nav4BNW1QDy7Unw8X6zyM8Kfc.webp`,n1:`1`},{slug:`r2`,f1:"他们没有向我们推销 AI，而是和团队一起工作了两天，找出每周浪费的九个小时，并将这些工作自动化。",f2:`Marcus Webb`,f3:"财务负责人",f4:`Ledgerly`,img:`https://framerusercontent.com/images/Krqms3NaMy8nEwjrtqUIO3c.webp`,n1:`2`},{slug:`r3`,f1:"如今，71% 的工单无需人工处理，客户满意度也提升了。我没想到两者能同时实现。",f2:`Priya Nair`,f3:"客户体验负责人",f4:`Oakline Home`,img:`https://framerusercontent.com/images/SI7SREshQvn5x8FfyPCRtuRGW40.webp`,n1:`3`},{slug:`r4`,f1:"高效、细致，并坦诚说明 AI 的能力边界。仅评估这一步就已收回成本。",f2:`Daniel Ortiz`,f3:"首席运营官",f4:`Brightpath Realty`,img:`https://framerusercontent.com/images/LJ6VyYaPa73NdCNpktKXjIwd4.webp`,n1:`4`},{slug:`r5`,f1:"我们的律师几秒钟就能检索 14 年的案件资料。这是他们每天早上最先打开的工具。",f2:`Helen Park`,f3:"管理合伙人",f4:`Vantage Legal`,img:`https://framerusercontent.com/images/mxSZ7D3i0xytLsGiCkGbSf1Z9rc.webp`,n1:`5`}]},Zr=`FcReviews@cms1`,Qr=(e,t=`img`)=>String(e&&e[t]||``).split(`?`)[0],$r=`data:image/svg+xml;utf8,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D'http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg'%20viewBox%3D'0%200%20400%20500'%20preserveAspectRatio%3D'xMidYMid%20slice'%3E%3Crect%20width%3D'400'%20height%3D'500'%20fill%3D'%23D3D8E2'%2F%3E%3Crect%20x%3D'120'%20y%3D'170'%20width%3D'160'%20height%3D'160'%20rx%3D'8'%20fill%3D'none'%20stroke%3D'%23AEB6C6'%20stroke-width%3D'1.5'%2F%3E%3Crect%20x%3D'100'%20y%3D'150'%20width%3D'200'%20height%3D'200'%20rx%3D'10'%20fill%3D'none'%20stroke%3D'%23C3CAD8'%20stroke-width%3D'1'%20stroke-dasharray%3D'2%206'%2F%3E%3C%2Fsvg%3E`,ei=(e,t=`img`)=>Qr(e,t)||$r,ti=a===voi